lete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YpCf1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc997043-7c2b-49de-acec-e81e2f93b6f1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"さくらのVPS も conoha も HDDプラン無いのか","ts":"1626097929.416800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pmxM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61f6d5c0-bbc5-4f3e-aaef-02393b572bfc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://yosida95.com/2013/05/19/003744.html\u003e","ts":"1626097813.416200","attachments":[{"fallback":"yosida95: Ubuntu のパッケージリポジトリのミラーをローカルに建てたら幸せになった話 — yosida95","id":1,"title":"Ubuntu のパッケージリポジトリのミラーをローカルに建てたら幸せになった話 — yosida95","title_link":"https://yosida95.com/2013/05/19/003744.html","text":"このやりかただと、これに引っかかるみたいです｡別の方法を考えないと \u003chttp://t.co/W80Sl9Fj0C\u003e / “Ubuntu のパッケージリポジトリのミラーをローカルに建てたら幸せになった話 - yosid…” \u003chttp://t.co/Q2bQOlhxQ2\u003e...","thumb_url":"https://yosida95.com/_static/icon_200x200.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"yosida95","service_icon":"https://yosida95.com/favicon.ico","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://yosida95.com/2013/05/19/003744.html","original_url":"https://yosida95.com/2013/05/19/003744.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2kf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b84212e0-d4e5-4a01-afdb-03df41c306e6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"msysじゃないけど自宅にUbuntuだったかDebianだったかのミラー立ててた人の話を読んだな","ts":"1626097758.416000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XXLx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94471e67-d983-4c45-8daf-98e854e54584","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://www.msys2.org/dev/mirrors/#adding-a-new-mirror\u003e\nmsys2 って 300GiB もあればミラーできるのか…\nどっかでホスティングしたい気がする","ts":"1626097511.415100","attachments":[{"fallback":"MSYS2 - Mirrors","id":1,"title":"MSYS2 - Mirrors","title_link":"https://www.msys2.org/dev/mirrors/#adding-a-new-mirror","text":"Software Distribution and Building Platform for Windows","image_url":"https://www.msys2.org/logo.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"msys2.org","service_icon":"https://www.msys2.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.msys2.org/dev/mirrors/#adding-a-new-mirror","original_url":"https://www.msys2.org/dev/mirrors/#adding-a-new-mirror"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zlbH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02bed3ad-adcb-4ea7-ae4f-37370ce43555","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これで行けました！！","ts":"1626064819.414400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qzw2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2a47586-2057-4b28-ad7f-13eeddf6f77b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"```@echo off\nsetlocal\n\nset ARGS=\n\nfor /f \"usebackq tokens=1 delims==\" %%i in (`gh repo list --json nameWithOwner -q \".[].nameWithOwner\" ^| fzf`) do set ARGS=%%i\ngh repo clone %ARGS%```","ts":"1626064810.413900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vwh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e03fc6b-cbb2-45d9-ba94-07358890791d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ、でもxarg的なバッチのほうが使えそうかも","ts":"1626064510.413500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pFe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cad1230-c84a-4199-9d13-68bd81779a7f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど、一つ目のバッチファイルは、親プロセスと子プロセスの２つ用意する感じでしょうか？","ts":"1626064477.413100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d=x5v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b7d2a60-6fc5-4039-a5c8-c5d56ac43f74","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```@echo off\n\nsetlocal\n\nset PATH=C:\\Program Files\\Docker\\Docker\\resources;%PATH%\n\nset ARGS=\nfor /f \"usebackq tokens=1 delims==\" %%i in (`docker ps -a -q`) do call :add %%i\nif \"%ARGS%\" neq \"\" (\n  docker rm -f %ARGS%\n)\n\nset ARGS=\nfor /f \"usebackq tokens=1 delims==\" %%i in (`docker images -q`) do call :add %%i\nif \"%ARGS%\" neq \"\" (\n  docker rmi -f %ARGS%\n)\nexit /b\n\n:add\nif \"%ARGS%\"==\"\" (\n  set ARGS=%*\n) else (\n  set ARGS=%ARGS% %*\n)```\ndocker の image を消すバッチとして使ってる。","ts":"1626064372.412000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eI/LE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ded5aea-173f-4407-8fd2-074a54808163","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"xargs みたいな事をする場合には、まだ少し楽。","ts":"1626064351.411500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"maR9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fde8820d-3f66-44e3-a1e5-bc79d8ea2079","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"バッチファイルで `$(xxx)` みたいな事するの、こうしないといけないのですよね。非常にめんどう。\n```@echo off\n\nsetlocal enabledelayedexpansion\nset output=\nfor /f \"eol=; tokens=1 delims==;\" %%i in ('dir') do (\n    set output=!output!^\n\n%%i\n)\necho !output!```","ts":"1626063430.411200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"liJfs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"888e3a2d-656a-4f33-b79c-8b4667d64fb9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`bash /path/to/myscript` だけ書いたバッチ用意しとけばcmdから呼び出せるし。","ts":"1626058246.410200","thread_ts":"1626058246.410200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JBb+i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"448b96fd-af51-44e5-85be-49a4cb5fe0d8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"cmdからbash起動すればよいだけでしょ?","ts":"1626058181.409000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yoMLd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7177b9fd-d92a-40d7-b5b5-4a5414a8030a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"cmd軽くて結構使用感良かったので、それなりの環境つくりたかったんですけど確かにコストが高いか…","ts":"1626058165.408600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y8E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cbdbf06-d7c3-4167-9190-8ce1c6f1b49e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まぁ確かに","ts":"1626058105.407400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"egGq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3738138d-d28d-4adb-826a-349d70646d57","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとbatで消耗するくらいなら msys2 でも入れてbash 使っちゃったほうが楽そうではある。","ts":"1626058096.407100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dfanI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c187436b-54d1-4694-b2ef-39ffedf68283","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"構文解釈的の機能から推測するに。","ts":"1626057990.406200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+fRq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1b99380-ca2f-4dcf-b496-809f2792ab70","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そもそも `[` がどうやって実現されてるのかよくわかんないけども、なんか `[` と `exec` および `}` と `]` の間にスペース要らんの?","ts":"1626057974.405800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yPM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e7e480c-4fe4-4005-ab05-c416107eb980","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"そうですね","ts":"1626057852.404100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eBV/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b190bdae-ee2c-438c-b06a-e20460707d62","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たぶん `[exec ...]` が 意図通りには解釈されてないって話だよね?","ts":"1626057841.403800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yhABS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62267db1-2491-44f5-8a89-d3c546fe340e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"が帰ってきてしまいます。この場合どう書いたらいいでしょうか？","ts":"1626057741.402900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0f08G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77a0e645-e1ee-42b4-8e35-147cc1cec804","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ですが、結果として\n```unknown flag: --json\nSeparate git clone flags with '--'.```","ts":"1626057716.402200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"brc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c774182-1fd2-4ca6-9299-21bedb1c84e2","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど。\nやりたいことはcmdで以下のコマンドを実行したいです\n`gh repo clone $(gh repo list $1 --json nameWithOwner -q '.[].nameWithOwner' | fzf)`\n自分でも調べてみて現時点で、以下のようなバッチファイルをかきました\n`gh repo clone [exec cmd /c {gh repo list --json nameWithOwner -q \".[].nameWithOwner\" ^| fzf}]`","ts":"1626057693.401800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s8km"}]},{"client_msg_id":"491dcd2a-ab4f-491f-bc6a-560a1f6ce23d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"純粋にバッチファイルは `$(xxx)` は出来ないので変数に預ける必要があります。","ts":"1626052475.400000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uj="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7716ced-2fca-47be-915e-a2614e7fac36","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"パスの変換とかはいるかもだけど","ts":"1626058263.410400","thread_ts":"1626058246.410200","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QPF"}]}]
